description.p:
This system works thanks to an electric suction pump that takes the healing and/or scenting product from a tank placed in the same container of the apparatus. By means of a hose-pipe, preferably having a non-return valve at its half length to avoid the product escapes when not in use, the electric pump 

propels the product towards a nozzle that emits a 360° vaporization of about . pressure bar. Everything is controlled by an electronic card powered by a dry rechargeable battery. This battery is chosen on the basis of the operation time of the system that is connected in its turn to the amount of vaporization to be emitted. Anyway this battery should last at least 10 days, considering 10/12 vaporization issues per day. The apparatus is composed by a container that may be realized with different materials - PVC, glass fibre, galvanized sheet iron -, a dry rechargeable battery, an electronic card; a hosepipe with internal hole; a non-return valve to avoid the product escapes in the absence of pressure inside the pipe; an electric pump for liquids; at least one tank, of variable capacity, to contain the healing and/or scenting liquid. A system for healing and/or scenting rubbish bins and the relative apparatus according to the invention, comprises: means to contain healing and/or scenting substances, with one or more tanks (1, 1A) equipped with a specific entrance hole (3, 3A) where the substance is poured; - means to take these substances from each tank, with one or more electric pumps (2, 2A) for liquids, connected to the tank(s); this pump takes the product through a pipe that contains a non-return valve and is put into the tank as well as connected to the pump; - means to vaporize the healing and/or scenting product, with the said pump, which propels the product towards a nozzle (13, 13A) that emits the vaporization; 

 means to program the phases of the vaporization at predetermined intervals, with an electric circuit that controls the apparatus functioning; means to power the circuit, with a lead rechargeable battery.
